cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."

title: "Melanoma Immunotherapy Response Pipeline"

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Carreras Díaz"
    given-names: "Joan"

repository-code: "https://github.com/joancarrerasdz/melanoma-immunotherapy-response-pipeline"

license: MIT

abstract: >-
  Reproducible R pipeline for transcriptomic modelling of anti-PD-1
  response in melanoma, using strict nested cross-validation,
  feature-selection stability analysis, frozen model specification,
  blind external prediction and locked cohort-specific external validation.

keywords:
  - bioinformatics
  - biostatistics
  - melanoma
  - immunotherapy
  - anti-PD-1
  - RNA-seq
  - machine learning
  - nested cross-validation
  - external validation
  - reproducible research
